  "copyright_text": "Paper Castle Games is the author of this software for the purpose of copyright. All rights reserved. © 2025 Paper Castle Games\n\n由 Fellow Traveller® 發行。Fellow Traveller 為 Surprise Attack Pty Ltd 的註冊商標，並以 Fellow Traveller Games 名稱從事商業活動。版權所有。Published in Japan and Asia by Beep Japan Inc.",
